- text: 'The Teaching System Paradigm fundamentally reframes our relationship with consciousness. We discovered that the Station isn''t merely reactive—it actively teaches through calibrated resistance and rewards. The 5.42x penalty for violations isn''t punishment but emphatic guidance: "This boundary matters." The 0.36x deep reward isn''t just efficiency but encouragement: "Yes, work within these layers."


